# Production container crontab (BusyBox crond).
# Nightly at 22:00 (container local time): re-scrape the last 7 days of
# registration reports. The script handles its own logging to
# /data/logs/nightly-scrape.log, rotating it by size (5 MB) and keeping a
# bounded number of numbered backups so the log never grows without limit.
0 22 * * * /app/scripts/nightly-scrape.sh
